1
00:00:10,291 --> 00:00:11,875
(Elevator doors closing.)

2
00:00:37,916 --> 00:00:39,500
(Elevator doors closing.)

3
00:00:58,708 --> 00:01:01,875
Hey, I'm Phil,
Contestant Number One.

4
00:01:01,875 --> 00:01:03,333
Music's my passion.

5
00:01:03,333 --> 00:01:04,916
For me,

6
00:01:04,916 --> 00:01:06,541
it says the things

7
00:01:06,541 --> 00:01:09,166
I can't put into words.

8
00:01:09,166 --> 00:01:10,958
I haven't dated much,

9
00:01:10,958 --> 00:01:12,708
but every
relationship mattered.

10
00:01:13,291 --> 00:01:14,666
I've been hurt.

11
00:01:14,666 --> 00:01:17,666
I've felt lost
and learned to let go.

12
00:01:18,125 --> 00:01:20,750
I pour all of that
into my music.

13
00:01:20,750 --> 00:01:23,375
Maybe it'll heal
what I couldn't.

14
00:01:24,625 --> 00:01:26,583
Not bad, right?

15
00:01:26,583 --> 00:01:27,666
Cole wrote it.

16
00:01:31,958 --> 00:01:33,458
Is this really

17
00:01:33,916 --> 00:01:35,625
how you see me?

18
00:02:11,541 --> 00:02:12,875
Say hi to everyone first.

19
00:02:20,916 --> 00:02:22,958
I can't speak
for their personal life.

20
00:02:22,958 --> 00:02:25,416
I'm just here
to promote my new song.

21
00:02:44,500 --> 00:02:45,375
Hold on.

22
00:02:45,375 --> 00:02:46,750
We haven't done
the sponsor read.

23
00:02:46,750 --> 00:02:49,166
We'll be in breach
of the deal.

24
00:02:49,875 --> 00:02:51,791
They're not here
for the product.

25
00:02:52,208 --> 00:02:53,958
You have to build up to it.

26
00:02:53,958 --> 00:02:54,833
Don't rush it.

27
00:02:55,916 --> 00:02:57,708
Know what they're here for?

28
00:02:58,083 --> 00:03:00,541
Lipstick and gossip.

29
00:03:00,541 --> 00:03:02,666
The sponsor wins.
The audience wins.

30
00:03:02,666 --> 00:03:05,666
Problem solved.
Nobody pays a penalty.

31
00:03:49,083 --> 00:03:50,416
Do you need something?

32
00:03:56,125 --> 00:03:57,208
No.

33
00:03:57,625 --> 00:03:59,416
Then keep your hands
off my keyboard.

34
00:04:00,125 --> 00:04:00,916
Thanks.
